.TH SUCCUBID 1 "August 2026" "succubid"

.SH NAME
succubid \- synchronize MPV with The Handy

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B succubid
.BI \-k " CONNECTION_KEY"
.RI [ OPTIONS ]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B succubid
Synchronizes MPV video playback with The Handy funscript playback.

Configuration may be provided through command-line options or environment
variables. Command-line options take precedence.

For safety, succubid refuses to run as root.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-k ", " \-\-key " " CONNECTION_KEY
Handy connection key.
Required.

.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-firmware " " FW3 | FW4
Handy firmware version.
Default:
.BR FW3 .

.TP
.BR \-a ", " \-\-auth " " AUTH_KEY
Handy V3 API authentication key.
Required when using
.BR FW4 .

Ignored on
.BR FW3 .

.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-socket " " PATH
Path to the MPV IPC socket.

Default:
.BR /tmp/mpv.sock .

.TP
.BR \-u ", " \-\-upload " " URL
Script upload server.

Default:
.br
https://www.handyfeeling.com/api/hosting/v2/upload

.TP
.BR \-l ", " \-\-local
Serve scripts locally instead of uploading them.

This option is supported only with FW3.

.TP
.BR \-g ", " \-\-gui
Prompt for a script inside MPV when multiple matching funscripts are found.

.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display a help message and exit.

.SH ENVIRONMENT
Each option may also be configured through an environment variable.

.TP
.B SUCCUBID_HANDY_CONNECTION_KEY
Equivalent to
.BR \-\-key .

.TP
.B SUCCUBID_HANDY_CONNECTION_AUTH
Equivalent to
.BR \-\-auth .

.TP
.B SUCCUBID_HANDY_API_VERSION
Equivalent to
.BR \-\-firmware .

.TP
.B SUCCUBID_MPV_SOCKET_PATH
Equivalent to
.BR \-\-socket .

.TP
.B SUCCUBID_HANDY_UPLOAD_SERVER
Equivalent to
.BR \-\-upload .

.TP
.B SUCCUBID_SERVE_LOCAL
Equivalent to
.BR \-\-local .

Accepted values (case-insensitive):
.BR true ,
.BR yes ,
.BR on ,
.BR 1 .

Any other value is treated as false.

.TP
.B SUCCUBID_USE_GUI
Equivalent to
.BR \-\-gui .

Accepted values (case-insensitive):
.BR true ,
.BR yes ,
.BR on ,
.BR 1 .

Any other value is treated as false.

.SH NOTES
FW4 requires an authentication key.

Local script serving is supported on FW3 only.

.SH EXAMPLES
Start with the minimum required configuration:

.PP
.nf
succubid -k CONNECTION_KEY
.fi

Use a FW4 device:

.PP
.nf
succubid -k CONNECTION_KEY -f FW4 -a AUTH_KEY
.fi

Serve scripts locally:

.PP
.nf
succubid -k CONNECTION_KEY -l
.fi

Enable the script selector:

.PP
.nf
succubid -k CONNECTION_KEY -g
.fi

Use a custom MPV socket:

.PP
.nf
succubid -k CONNECTION_KEY -s /run/user/1000/mpv.sock
.fi

Configure with environment variables:

.PP
.nf
export SUCCUBID_HANDY_CONNECTION_KEY=CONNECTION_KEY
export SUCCUBID_USE_GUI=true
succubid
.fi

.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.

.TP
.B 1
Failure.

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mpv (1)
